  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 2207.02 General Grant Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 2207.02 General Grant Requirements. Recipients shall adhere to the following requirements throughout the grant term:\n\n(a) Attend commencement and periodic check-in meetings that the department may schedule, as necessary;\n\n(b) Allow inspections of project facilities by the department; and\n\n(c) Provide copies of project-related documents to verify compliance with the grant agreement, as requested by the department.\n\nSource. #14633, eff 7-1-26, EXPIRES: 7-1-36\n\nAPPENDIX A: STATE STATUTES IMPLEMENTED",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw2200.html"
}
